<gpx version="1.1" creator="galicica.finereli.com" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:gpxx="http://www.garmin.com/xmlschemas/GpxExtensions/v3" xmlns:gpx_style="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/gpx_style/0/2">
<metadata><name>Ramne - Letnica - Visok Vrv - Krstec - Velestovo</name><desc>A mostly west-facing trail with the climbing spread fairly evenly. Parts are in low vegetation, higher parts in forest, and the highest stretch is open ground with wide views. The ground is hard and stony, grassy in places. In several places, especially below Letnica and at Skala, you cross streams that are easy to cross for most of the year. https://galicica.finereli.com/routes/ramne-letnica-visok-vrv-krstec-velestovo/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="41.109330" lon="20.836980"><name>Start: Ramne village</name><desc>Ramne village to Velestovo village: 11.7 km, 5 h 15 min, moderate</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.083602" lon="20.828031"><name>Start: Velestovo village</name><desc>Velestovo village to Ramne village: 11.7 km, 4 h 45 min, moderate</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<trk><name>G-1: the H-4 junction to the T-3 junction</name><desc>G-1 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It's 4.7 km from the H-4 junction to the T-3 junction, with about 193 m of climbing and 124 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 1,454 m and 1,627 m.</desc><type>G</type><extensions><gpxx:TrackExtension><gpxx:DisplayColor>Yellow</gpxx:DisplayColor></gpxx:TrackExtension><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>D4A20B</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>4</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.102053" lon="20.867382"><ele>1454</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102156" lon="20.867195"><ele>1458</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.103029" lon="20.867189"><ele>1473</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.103851" lon="20.866690"><ele>1487</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104061" lon="20.866097"><ele>1490</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104425" lon="20.865915"><ele>1490</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104576" lon="20.865395"><ele>1493</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.105241" lon="20.864818"><ele>1500</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.105214" lon="20.864470"><ele>1501</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104937" lon="20.864338"><ele>1499</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104557" lon="20.863900"><ele>1499</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104301" lon="20.863383"><ele>1514</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.104046" lon="20.863278"><ele>1518</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.103774" lon="20.863494"><ele>1520</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.103643" lon="20.863179"><ele>1521</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.103375" lon="20.863314"><ele>1523</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102835" lon="20.862892"><ele>1527</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102730" lon="20.862555"><ele>1535</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102483" lon="20.862386"><ele>1539</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102402" lon="20.861919"><ele>1552</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102195" lon="20.861881"><ele>1558</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.102032" lon="20.861574"><ele>1575</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.101698" lon="20.861591"><ele>1579</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.101851" lon="